DOCUMENT();
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'MathObjects.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');
TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_C242_34B4';
<p>c242_34b4</p> <h4>Three-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a three-point test cross examines three (3) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard three-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for all three genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for all three genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for three genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #993e11;">Gene A</span></strong> is correlated with the '<span style="color: #993e11;"><i>artsy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #993e11;">Gene A</span> has wings that are colorful and distinctive patterns.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #286d3f;">Gene C</span></strong> is correlated with the '<span style="color: #286d3f;"><i>chummy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #286d3f;">Gene C</span> shows behavior where it always maintains a close distance to other flies.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #7441a6;">Gene W</span></strong> is related to the '<span style="color: #7441a6;"><i>waxy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #7441a6;">Gene W</span> has a thick protective layer that is water resistant and opague.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="3" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">artsy, chummy, waxy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe4da; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">a</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d4f4d6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">c</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f2e4ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">w</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">23,313</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">artsy, chummy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe4da; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">a</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d4f4d6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">c</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #7441a6;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">31,847</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">artsy, waxy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe4da; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">a</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #286d3f;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f2e4ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">w</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">50,702</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">artsy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe4da; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">a</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #286d3f;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #7441a6;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">4,032</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">chummy, waxy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #993e11;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d4f4d6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">c</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f2e4ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">w</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">3,836</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">chummy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #993e11;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d4f4d6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">c</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #7441a6;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">51,172</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">waxy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #993e11;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #286d3f;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f2e4ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">w</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">31,895</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #993e11;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #286d3f;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #7441a6;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">23,203</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">220,000</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>With the progeny data from the table, and using only the genotypes that result from crossover events between the two genes <b>A</b> and <b>C</b> during meiosis.</p> <p><strong>calculate the genetic distance between the two genes <b>A</b> and <b>C</b>,</strong> expressing your answer in centimorgans (cM)</p>
PROMPT_C242_34B4
loadMacros('parserRadioButtons.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_C242_34B4_CHOICE_1';
<sup>(23,203 + 23,313 + 31,847 + 31,895)</sup>/<sub>220,000</sub> = <sup>110,258</sup>/<sub>220,000</sub> = 0.5012 = <strong>50.12 cM</strong>
LITERAL_C242_34B4_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_C242_34B4_CHOICE_2';
<sup>(3,836 + 4,032 + 23,203 + 23,313)</sup>/<sub>220,000</sub> = <sup>54,384</sup>/<sub>220,000</sub> = 0.2472 = <strong>24.72 cM</strong>
LITERAL_C242_34B4_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_C242_34B4_CHOICE_3';
<sup>(3,836 + 4,032 + 31,847 + 31,895)</sup>/<sub>220,000</sub> = <sup>71,610</sup>/<sub>220,000</sub> = 0.3255 = <strong>32.55 cM</strong>
LITERAL_C242_34B4_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_C242_34B4_CHOICE_4';
<sup>(4,032 + 23,203 + 23,313 + 31,847)</sup>/<sub>220,000</sub> = <sup>82,395</sup>/<sub>220,000</sub> = 0.3745 = <strong>37.45 cM</strong>
LITERAL_C242_34B4_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_C242_34B4_CHOICE_5';
<sup>(4,032 + 23,313 + 31,895 + 51,172)</sup>/<sub>220,000</sub> = <sup>110,412</sup>/<sub>220,000</sub> = 0.5019 = <strong>50.19 cM</strong>
LITERAL_C242_34B4_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_C242_34B4_CHOICE_6';
<sup>(50,702 + 51,172)</sup>/<sub>220,000</sub> = <sup>101,874</sup>/<sub>220,000</sub> = 0.4631 = <strong>46.31 cM</strong>
LITERAL_C242_34B4_CHOICE_6
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_C242_34B4_CORRECT_1';
<sup>(23,203 + 23,313 + 31,847 + 31,895)</sup>/<sub>220,000</sub> = <sup>110,258</sup>/<sub>220,000</sub> = 0.5012 = <strong>50.12 cM</strong>
LITERAL_C242_34B4_CORRECT_1
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6);
$answer = RadioButtons([@choices], $correct_1, labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, noindex => 1, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
TEXT(MODES(HTML => $prompt, TeX => ''));
BEGIN_TEXT
\{$answer->buttons\}
END_TEXT
ANS($answer->cmp);

